    "what_en": "This skill enables Claude to fetch unresolved Sentry issues for buildwithfern/cli, filter against a triage ledger, deduplicate existing PRs, group issues by call site, spawn parallel subagents for classification and fixes, and optionally create a parent reconciliation PR.",
    "when_en": "Triggered when you ask to investigate Sentry CLI issues, classify false positives, update the triage ledger, or create PRs for Sentry error fixes.",
    "say_en": [
      {
        "text": "Investigate whether Sentry issue CLI-44 is a false positive.",
        "note": "Claude will fetch the issue details and run the triage workflow."
      },
      {
        "text": "Update the triage ledger record for CLI-2W to shipped.",
        "note": "Claude will modify the ledger file and may create a PR."
